WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.870 --> 00:00:03.330
Anna: Hi, today we're testing the subtitle generator.

2
00:00:03.870 --> 00:00:04.370
Boris: Great.

3
00:00:04.590 --> 00:00:07.470
I've prepared a very long sentence with plenty of commas

4
00:00:07.890 --> 00:00:10.470
so we can check how the tool splits it into parts,

5
00:00:10.770 --> 00:00:14.850
without breaking a phrase in the middle, and without exceeding the line length.

6
00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:18.450
Anna: What happens if I pause... and then continue?

7
00:00:20.370 --> 00:00:22.110
Speaker 3: <lang ru>А теперь короткая фраза по-русски.</lang>

8
00:00:22.890 --> 00:00:24.330
Speaker 4: <lang es>Y una frase corta en español.</lang>

9
00:00:25.110 --> 00:00:25.610
Boris: Yes.

10
00:00:26.550 --> 00:00:28.290
Anna: Okay, that's the end of the test.

